      "updated": 1788367534350,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Follow ups\n1. canonical.ad_spend_daily instead of canonical-sstatic\nCleaner final design is a boost-owned spend relation built from stable ad ownership, rather then depending on old canonical pipeline.\n\nRevenue has a proven advertiser and ad ID, but there is no physical spend row for that same ad on the revenue's event date.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Follow ups\n1. canonical.ad_spend_daily instead of canonical-sstatic\nCleaner final design is a boost-owned spend relation built from stable ad ownership, rather then depending on old canonical pipeline.\n\nRevenue has a proven advertiser and ad ID, but there is no physical spend row for that same ad on the revenue's event date.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
